{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217610","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217610","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1321761001:1":{"text":"Congratulations! You won second place in the Doughball Fight!","source_cn":"恭喜各位大人！在面团雪仗的游戏中拿到了第二名的好成绩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD787A31FA55F93B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321761002:0":{"text":"First place belongs to the princess, right...?","source_cn":"第一名肯定又是公主殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4409F5FDAC69AB20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321761003:0":{"text":"Oh, yes. Let's see... your collection card is only missing color in two petals. Seems they're from the remaining activities in the audience chamber.","source_cn":"呀，你们的收集卡只剩下最后两瓣花朵没有涂上颜色了。除了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36DC4DB2775F4E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321761004:0":{"text":"You'd better hurry; the ball is about to begin.","source_cn":"抓紧时间体验吧。过不了多久，舞会应该就要开始了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AF50E77FF549F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321761005:0":{"text":"Thank you for the reminder.","source_cn":"好，多谢你的提醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88BE5762293E3411","variant